WEBVTT

00:03:27.529 --> 00:03:31.224
They're made from one hundred
percent natural material,

00:03:31.248 --> 00:03:32.973
a wooden frame and floor,

00:03:32.997 --> 00:03:34.149
leather rope

00:03:34.173 --> 00:03:37.355
and thick blankets
made from felted sheep's wool.

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:40.491
And it takes about only
three to four hours

00:03:40.515 --> 00:03:43.292
to assemble or disassemble,

00:03:43.316 --> 00:03:45.000
and keeps them warm

00:03:45.024 --> 00:03:48.468
through the minus 50 degree
Celsius winters.

00:03:49.738 --> 00:03:50.991
Outside the yurt,

00:03:51.015 --> 00:03:54.102
the kids were playing
with sheep and goats,

00:03:54.126 --> 00:03:55.578
and as I greeted them,

00:03:55.602 --> 00:03:57.688
their parents welcomed me inside.

00:03:58.137 --> 00:04:00.814
The wife poured me nice warm milk tea,